{"id":"9ebff8cc9ee6f73012c8df860e28f898bbf000bb","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238375","title":"尽职编程： AI 编码时代的个体差异的来源","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Joway","excerpt":"程序员 - @Joway - [<<尽职编程：AI 编码时代的个体差异的来源>>]( https://blog.joway.io/posts/software-engineering-with-ai-coding/)写了一","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p><a href=\"https://blog.joway.io/posts/software-engineering-with-ai-coding/\" rel=\"nofollow\">&lt;&lt;尽职编程：AI 编码时代的个体差异的来源&gt;&gt;</a></p>\n<p>写了一篇博客关于现在公司内的 AI Coding 现状，不少朋友都来和我反馈，说很贴切反映了他们的工作现实。大家一起以不同的靠谱程度大量 AI Coding ，协作起来真的非常痛苦。所以特别分享这篇文章在 V2EX ，可能可以获取更多共鸣。</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/编程\"><li></li> 编程</a><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/差异\"><li></li> 差异</a></P><p><span>16 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-01 08:37:19 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18034382\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7ed563fb491d74eebf02f624f7e99768?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"poxiaohy\" data-uid=\"25781\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/poxiaohy\">poxiaohy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-31 14:19:19 +08:00\">20h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>60 分和 80 、90 分的差距不是 AI 带来的，古法编程时代一样有这个问题。最近大家讨论 AI 编码问题，无论尽职的个人软件能力也好，技术架构问题的个人硬件实力也罢，AI 一直充当的都是放大器</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18034456\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/02a1/dd53/112102_normal.png?m=1760508787\" alt=\"sagnitude\" data-uid=\"112102\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sagnitude\">sagnitude</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-31 14:32:18 +08:00\">20h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>只不过古法时代可以体现在代码质量里面，很容易被 code review 看见罢了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18034568\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4a9d/7521/579174_normal.png?m=1764309578\" alt=\"pluviacon\" data-uid=\"579174\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pluviacon\">pluviacon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-31 14:53:19 +08:00\">19h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>确实不是会不会用 AI 的问题，而是有没有理解需求和现有代码的态度问题<br>有些提交看着能跑，但小功能都能写得又长又绕，Review 完了感觉还不如重新实现更快</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18034698\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/0651592f49a45db4eeeae31904e3912b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"JobsHwang\" data-uid=\"369851\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/JobsHwang\">JobsHwang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-31 15:21:34 +08:00\">19h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最近也有相同感悟。<br>「尽职编程」某种程度上就是：agent 能同时做越来越多的事，但最后仍要由一个有限的人守住上下文、判断和结果责任。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18034954\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2f5c2cdb9404a1425f280b72db0e6b66?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yangwa\" data-uid=\"485118\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yangwa\">yangwa</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-31 16:09:34 +08:00\">18h 31m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>方案不错，但是得有眼光的管理层，允许 review,和以前古法时代一样，没有多少项目组会给时间去做 review ，这种矛盾小，个人的尽职会越来越减少</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18035450\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9db7/9ed4/233999_normal.png?m=1499064063\" alt=\"liushengxian1230\" data-uid=\"233999\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/liushengxian1230\">liushengxian1230</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-31 17:42:51 +08:00\">16h 58m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>确实觉得如此。<br>不过公司内的个体差异探讨的前提在很多公司不成立，可能没有统一报销大家自己买自己的，或者用不同的模型/agent/hareness 都有可能，所以互联网上鲜有人讨论</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18035628\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/494d265ef76dc4bc51996860c947bd58?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"did\" data-uid=\"566072\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/did\">did</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-31 18:35:23 +08:00\">16h 6m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>同事 A: 这代码是我让 AI 写的，具体情况我也没看呢，有什么 bug 你就问 AI 让他给你修改。 同事 B: 这一看就是 AI 写的垃圾文档，都是重复的内容，至于是不是(其实不是)。  目前所在公司的真人真事。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18035631\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/494d265ef76dc4bc51996860c947bd58?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"did\" data-uid=\"566072\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/did\">did</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-31 18:36:22 +08:00\">16h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ai 是放大器，他会放大优点，也会放大缺点。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18035642\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/eefece6de7a8cd6ba5bbde2a73fde7f7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nakun233\" data-uid=\"627181\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nakun233\">nakun233</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-31 18:45:24 +08:00\">15h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>有没可能 review 这块也要形而上，人不能成为瓶颈</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18035646\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4505/454a/243182_normal.png?m=1725416416\" alt=\"SilenceLL\" data-uid=\"243182\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SilenceLL\">SilenceLL</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-31 18:47:49 +08:00\">15h 53m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>巧了，刚在 x 刷到</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18036286\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b6e3/d4df/545030_normal.png?m=1786599922\" alt=\"bwnjnOEI\" data-uid=\"545030\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bwnjnOEI\">bwnjnOEI</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 04:24:55 +08:00\">6h 16m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>看到你也花大量时间在理解模型产出的文档上我就没往下看了因为我也一样。抛开这点，agent 失败的地方都是文档内容点之间的空隙，你也是吗？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18036389\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3951/aebb/494405_normal.png?m=1740964378\" alt=\"monkeydream\" data-uid=\"494405\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/monkeydream\">monkeydream</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 08:37:19 +08:00\">2h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你就是懂技术的项目经理，把 AI 当作产品、架构师、高级开发、测试来用。<br>项目经理不是啥都不管，得看文档、技术架构、任务执行情况、测试结果评估是否要调整。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"<<尽职编程：AI 编码时代的个体差异的来源>> 写了一篇博客关于现在公司内的 AI Coding 现状，不少朋友都来和我反馈，说很贴切反映了他们的工作现实。大家一起以不同的靠谱程度大量 AI Coding ，协作起来真的非常痛苦。所以特别分享这篇文章在 V2EX ，可能可以获取更多共鸣。 编程 AI 差异16 replies • 2026-09-01 08:37:19 +08:00 1 poxiaohy 20h 22m ago 60 分和 80 、90 分的差距不是 AI 带来的，古法编程时代一样有这个问题。最近大家讨论 AI 编码问题，无论尽职的个人软